s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commit/5fe96deddb98c34643aa22271aef2a9d3d4324a8","node_id":"C_kwDOI0wA3doAKDVmZTk2ZGVkZGI5OGMzNDY0M2FhMjIyNzFhZWYyYTlkM2Q0MzI0YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commit/82ccd9e49874a18d08af1b1fde96d4d3edd2803d","sha":"82ccd9e49874a18d08af1b1fde96d4d3edd2803d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commits/82ccd9e49874a18d08af1b1fde96d4d3edd2803d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commit/c57b1c60cb3589ec4c88439904ee0fcd4085844c","sha":"c57b1c60cb3589ec4c88439904ee0fcd4085844c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commits/c57b1c60cb3589ec4c88439904ee0fcd4085844c"}],"sha":"5fe96deddb98c34643aa22271aef2a9d3d4324a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commits/5fe96deddb98c34643aa22271aef2a9d3d4324a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83585487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Josephalexantony-aot","id":83585487,"login":"Josephalexantony-aot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNTg1NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/commits/c57b1c60cb3589ec4c88439904ee0fcd4085844c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:06:32Z","email":"alex.antony@aot-technologies.com","name":"DESKTOP-978J9P7\\Dell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:57:37Z","email":"alex.antony@aot-technologies.com","name":"DESKTOP-978J9P7\\Dell"},"message":"FWF-6652: Fix invalid-token error saving from Manage -> Style in production/multitenancy\n\nforms-flow-admin is a single-spa microfrontend with its own private copy\nof @formsflow/service (not shared/externalized in webpack), so\nKeycloakService''s static singleton in admin''s bundle is a completely\nseparate object from the shell''s. index.tsx only called\nKeycloakService.getInstance(...).initKeycloak(...) when `isAuth` (derived\nfrom the shell''s own already-authenticated instance via\nprops.getKcInstance()) was false -- which is normally never, since the\nshell already logged the user in. So admin''s own singleton was never\npopulated.\n\nRequestService''s 401-retry interceptor calls KeycloakService.updateToken()\non THAT singleton to refresh an expired access token; with no instance it\nsilently returns null instead of refreshing, the retry goes out as\n\"Authorization: Bearer null\", the backend rejects it again, and the raw\n\"Invalid token\" message is shown as-is.\n\nThis mostly surfaced on the Style tab because composing a template (name,\ncolors, fonts, branding) is one of the few Manage actions a user\nplausibly leaves open for several minutes before saving -- long enough\nfor a production-tuned, short-lived access token to actually expire,\nunlike one-shot actions like toggling a user or creating a role.\n\nFix: always initialize admin''s own KeycloakService singleton on mount,\nregardless of `isAuth`. initKeycloak uses onLoad: \"check-sso\" (a silent\niframe check against the already-active SSO session), so this doesn''t\nintroduce a visible re-login or redirect -- it just makes sure this\nbundle''s own singleton, refresh loop, and updateToken() actually work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40722dbd8885cb7eac0a25c0563fa4a3c0ceae36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/git/trees/40722dbd8885cb7eac0a25c0563fa4a3c0ceae36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AOT-Technologies/forms-flow-ai-micro-front-ends/git/commits/c57b1c60cb3589ec4c88439904ee0fcd4085844c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83585487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Josephalexantony-aot","id":83585487,"login":"Josephalexantony-aot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNTg1NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josephalexantony-aot/subscriptions","type