x(app): full-width masthead and Settings Content padding\n\nRemove host CSS that inset the global header and hid its logo so the\nPatternFly masthead can span the viewport. Wrap the Settings General\npage in Content for consistent page padding.\n\nFixes: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-15742\nSigned-off-by: Yi Cai <yicai@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* addressed review comment\n\nSigned-off-by: Yi Cai <yicai@redhat.com>\n\n* fix(build): add missing openssl-libs entries to rpms.lock.yaml\n\nHermeto failed Build Image because openssl-libs was listed in rpms.in.yaml\nbut absent from the lockfile after the UBI openssl 3.5.8 bump.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Yi Cai <yicai@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b922c116932dad120fe3b22da9af82f275e55e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/b922c116932dad120fe3b22da9af82f275e55e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/a50428ebbdd830b783ed3d86a69445a73501d8f6","verification":{"payload":"tree b922c116932dad120fe3b22da9af82f275e55e6a\nparent 37772c4ddca963dd4f2740b62027498b5ef68889\nauthor Yi C <yicai@redhat.com> 1791410519 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791410519 +0000\n\nfix(app): full-width masthead and Settings Content padding (#5597)\n\n* fix(app): full-width masthead and Settings Content padding\n\nRemove host CSS that inset the global header and hid its logo so the\nPatternFly masthead can span the viewport. Wrap the Settings General\npage in Content for consistent page padding.\n\nFixes: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-15742\nSigned-off-by: Yi Cai <yicai@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* addressed review comment\n\nSigned-off-by: Yi Cai <yicai@redhat.com>\n\n* fix(build): add missing openssl-libs entries to rpms.lock.yaml\n\nHermeto failed Build Image because openss