.github.com/users/davidfestal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfestal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfestal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/2e92d1edbbc3322a210952a251c8212c2fff58ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:50:27Z","email":"dfestal@redhat.com","name":"David Festal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:50:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(backend): cache dynamic remotes static assets with long-lived Cache-Control (#5493)\n\nAdd `dynamicRemotesStaticCacheMiddleware` that sets a 14-day\n`Cache-Control` header for hashed Module Federation remote chunks served\nunder `/.backstage/dynamic-features/remotes/<plugin>/static/`. Wire it\ninto the default `rootHttpRouterServiceFactory` configuration so the\npolicy applies before the static handler runs, while leaving\n`remoteEntry.js` and `mf-manifest.json` uncached. Include unit tests for\nthe matching behavior.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"280b4b336bee6e28fe29297d27fa8a8850b5a0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/280b4b336bee6e28fe29297d27fa8a8850b5a0a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/2e92d1edbbc3322a210952a251c8212c2fff58ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 280b4b336bee6e28fe29297d27fa8a8850b5a0a3\nparent f854dfa63f0e72950989db61cfc0722d3ac63034\nauthor David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com> 1790592627 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790592627 +0000\n\nfeat(backend): cache dynamic remotes static assets with long-lived Cache-Control (#5493)\n\nAdd `dynamicRemotesStaticCacheMiddleware` that sets a 14-day\n`Cache-Control` header for hashed Module Federation remote chunks served\nunder `/.backstage/dynamic-features/remotes/<plugin>/static/`. Wire it\ninto the default `rootHttpRouterServiceFactory` configuration so the\npolicy applies before the static handler runs, while leaving\n`remoteEntry.js` and `mf-manifest.json` uncached. Include unit tests for\nthe matching behavior.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqukZzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALHYQAFq28/UHdJFZvSclBDSvS0o2\nGDEXgt5W742Xc7zeSoN3IIG871jA3+j7dosXzbKZKOuFaMHEYgLDooYJz/IPUujE\nCn3tlRDJtaJ0ikva0C/IlJJEgYteLQE+avxbPBZZOIXL5G2jQw/mfgmvbwkyclg8\naSSc6rE8dXo4VTnkThi2GWL/QVjiZiK7gG5apgyDb8YQbAaAEnVjF+IP2BPc3cJH\nEA7AALoa8McM+6ISGmLP5/MUAH8EFGB2T4iROcU/dj+gkdoW2ClfB36DxRoHnv2G\nYgMqMAav3sC1BPhr3q/4FsOgHqXA57HnikU0o4FR2sgk5LAbPeaNPfPXSFKWJOgk\nDCYkfaEpuGOzNoGBEIj2KMlVSfPUjrWVPVY+EaNtlMn3dNf6TqaFc1T8n25RKk+g\nNHzJEtSHLg82vvvnshmRr7wN/eNx5anJvKmvNVHaOwbPttQniu7cIlN/egrx4TaQ\nSqkQL6gXDIz977+BgD6JmWh9rXqF0gtFkK20RlRfI/sP9sg3/lDNg0Z89Eh0Zsjl\nX7BZhmSOqqFSlAg1HrAhk3O5WK5ImrNR1kvQ5z6lOxxNnk0VG+r2ZdNvnLTFORCd\n3ZRuK5Z4c/IPCjGMqw9H9f9nex9EjJI1pJCclHeYdZaoTESw7Vq08xfYq6eE5kIy\nzNAPJrJ1gp5wD+YS9Tf7\n=0WYB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T10:50:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions