te":"2026-09-28T10:06:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(backend): add dynamic features resolver with module federation preload (#5492)\n\nReplace the `nfsModuleFilterPlugin` with a new `dynamicFeaturesResolver`\nbackend plugin that:\n- Filters exposed modules to NFS entrypoints using `backstage.features`\n- Collects module federation snapshot data for dynamic plugins\n- Serves `/.backstage/dynamic-features-preload/preload.js`, which\n  prefills MF globals, shims the remotes fetch, and injects remoteEntry\n  and sync-asset hints\n- Adds the deferred preload script to `packages/app/public/index.html`\n\nAlso adds `@module-federation/sdk`, `express`, and `@backstage/types`\ndependencies and updates `yarn.lock`.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"e623b2c99bb2a37ef34221a24767491936bca964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/e623b2c99bb2a37ef34221a24767491936bca964"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/f854dfa63f0e72950989db61cfc0722d3ac63034","verification":{"payload":"tree e623b2c99bb2a37ef34221a24767491936bca964\nparent 53a348939a87d6c717852073ca044597fda74d30\nauthor David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com> 1790589967 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790589967 +0000\n\nfeat(backend): add dynamic features resolver with module federation preload (#5492)\n\nReplace the `nfsModuleFilterPlugin` with a new `dynamicFeaturesResolver`\nbackend plugin that:\n- Filters exposed modules to NFS entrypoints using `backstage.features`\n- Collects module federation snapshot data for dynamic plugins\n- Serves `/.backstage/dynamic-features-preload/preload.js`, which\n  prefills MF globals, shims the remotes fetch, and injects remoteEntry\n  and sync-asset hints\n- Adds the deferred preload script to `packages/app/public/index.html`\n\nAlso adds `@module-federation/sdk`, `express`, and `@backstage/types`\ndependencies and updates `yarn.lock`.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqujwPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARq4QAJhzzIeM+zaSzt0mQs2V02n8\nNDiO4SOTy1stvKxNoqmt5m/gkBxULA7TEm7d8dvX/9K0c/Ei3RNBPbwklicFsThG\nzX7VwkyV5ROMkxWB/cr9Bjb/DypL8FFPG6GfPaVsXlyTIpirAuk2hkSDOUpnVoDk\nRu9aUANypdQQux8il7pcGsElKc6qOPQm5O/Gd831+eVVcNRi9NKcY0jTViN+oD6x\nnNlmCZiw0+yvB0u3hbif47kmjHcqCxNjq+HWLnffGYChkKVIfpeQAt8/VV68aChC\nlHss03QPVDh9LXXxfW5ghJfk2JolBLcTi3B4Wk82IbcFU12lz093848aeFpHgwpr\nhbzqT0yqqExutqYNHYmrPDdAJC80RACbGPnlCQlvSxfdq4Y38UUOMWzIEKYXeScr\nEEeuiNRufnSGJmC2+0NUJDhZDENgjVuQf076rNWe3VYWg2UJjYL9LDLaTfxiM/zv\nXuc0ldOzjytsN75fdQwxAo1A1rqtxicsq2ZdmLUecrZTpBuQ6uWisMx/QYfZLwXd\nW477UxnADLGjZWw4Uh1szz8UjNJb8vdeHcLE+S7neuboS1Z0xY0hW+yuS1IHIwhd\n26hU/nzLU+rCseot+WH9uHrayqDpqwHno6TZeQ32BYXHxjHe+BZfL3qUF9zTyTtX\nmtWYdWvXea8brDtCxFaT\n=IZCN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T10:06:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redhat-developer/rhdh/commit/