ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfestal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfestal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/f7155ae8c0833d918daaa2283cf39a005e9b9244/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:29:29Z","email":"dfestal@redhat.com","name":"David Festal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:29:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(app): add enhanced runtime shared dependencies for module federation (#5491)\n\n* feat(app): add enhanced runtime shared dependencies for module federation\n\nRegister additional shared libraries (core-components, frontend-plugin-api,\ncore-plugin-api, zod, lodash, material-ui/core) at runtime so dynamic plugins\ncan resolve them through module federation.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>\n\n* refactor(app): simplify enhanced module federation shared setup\n\nResolve shared-dependency versions via static package.json imports and\nregister them before createApp so the dynamic features loader stays\nunchanged.\n\nRef: RHIDP-16304\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(app): no-op enhanced sharing when the host is unset\n\nReturn early when the runtime shared-dependencies global is missing\ninstead of treating an empty object as v1. That removes the need to\nseed the global in the App smoke test.\n\nRef: RHIDP-16304\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: run prettier\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"20d25ad71f47399cd9e8ef6f7d08fe700bb7e134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/20d25ad71f47399cd9e8ef6f7d08fe700bb7e134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/f7155ae8c0833d918daaa2283cf39a005e9b9244","verification":{"payload":"tree 20d25ad71f47399cd9e8ef6f7d08fe700bb7e134\nparent 55c6defa1a647f56e34758a806b013635fd81785\nauthor David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com> 1790285369 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790285369 +0000\n\nfeat(app): add enhanced runtime shared dependencies for module federation (#5491)\n\n* feat(app): add enhanced runtime shared dependencies for module federation\n\nRegister additional shared libraries (core-components, frontend-plugin-api,\ncore-plugin-api, zod, lodash, material-ui/core) at runtime so dynamic plugins\ncan resolve them through module federation.\n\nAssisted-by: Cursor\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>\n\n* refactor(app): simplify enhanced module federation shared setup\n\nResolve shared-dependency versions via static package.json imports and\nregister them before createApp so the dynamic features loader stays\nunchanged.\n\nRef: RHIDP-16304\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(app): no-op enhanced sharing when the host is unset\n\nReturn early when the runtime shared-dependencies global is missing\ninstead of treating an empty object as v1. That removes the need to\nseed the global in the App smoke test.\n\nRef: RHIDP-16304\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: run prettier\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: David Festal <dfestal@redhat.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtZY5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtzwQAFEvG89mMAHYQv7m+SnXO1rs\nPWB8ko+vRQsZqsbxnF0FnvutihLDVEZ93qy9BiH+iowoLCGfAcYDO29OeWCJjTkw\nkuLrzV3YmKBPmp0vWvBt4of4L6IRjt0Lu6UD9pvtpbaL9sVNfHrAkdio/I/5bBDC\nQwsrd0sshK9i7bB7W9hJ4wEGB5sfB50YtWR9az5HiXUfuQvEgxAxGKRfuq1hEepO\nU+8bt7/U5Se/nffCd3Fc2gplyGsJgYv0Mz/MW+CUGQGI92Rp5EkyV4Jl93TFT1L