/nickboldt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickboldt","id":227597,"login":"nickboldt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzU5Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/464e465eb12ae440c43313d11368e9fd9c46f367/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:26:20Z","email":"nboldt@redhat.com","name":"Nick Boldt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:26:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): drop unused Python and perl RPM pins from hub build (#5480)\n\n* chore(deps): drop unused Python RPM pins from hub build\n\nRemove redundant python3.12-{idna,requests,setuptools,urllib3,pip-wheel}\nfrom rpms.in.yaml and stop explicitly installing python-unversioned-command\nin the skeleton stage (runner already provides /usr/bin/python via\nalternatives). Regenerate rpms.lock.yaml; keep python3.12/pip/devel for\nthe TechDocs venv build.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(deps): drop unused python3-setuptools RPM pins\n\nTechDocs installs setuptools into the venv via pip; UBI10 python3/pip\ndo not Require the setuptools or setuptools-wheel RPMs.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(deps): use git-core only; drop skeleton perl RPM pins\n\nBuild only needs git config (from git-core). The full git RPM pulled\nperl and ~60 perl-* packages into the hermetic pin; drop them and\ngit-core-doc.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rhdh-bot <rhdh-bot@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Frank Kong <50030060+Zaperex@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d29e60a9d92ea0ae3d174a4f44a066e379b2c46c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/d29e60a9d92ea0ae3d174a4f44a066e379b2c46c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/464e465eb12ae440c43313d11368e9fd9c46f367","verification":{"payload":"tree d29e60a9d92ea0ae3d174a4f44a066e379b2c46c\nparent 3a33afc61bdf672fef35d7c96d1aa631e56e6cd0\nauthor Nick Boldt <nboldt@redhat.com> 1790195180 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790195180 +0000\n\nchore(deps): drop unused Python and perl RPM pins from hub build (#5480)\n\n* chore(deps): drop unused Python RPM pins from hub build\n\nRemove redundant python3.12-{idna,requests,setuptools,urllib3,pip-wheel}\nfrom rpms.in.yaml and stop explicitly installing python-unversioned-command\nin the skeleton stage (runner already provides /usr/bin/python via\nalternatives). Regenerate rpms.lock.yaml; keep python3.12/pip/devel for\nthe TechDocs venv build.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(deps): drop unused python3-setuptools RPM pins\n\nTechDocs installs setuptools into the venv via pip; UBI10 python3/pip\ndo not Require the setuptools or setuptools-wheel RPMs.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(deps): use git-core only; drop skeleton perl RPM pins\n\nBuild only needs git config (from git-core). The full git RPM pulled\nperl and ~60 perl-* packages into the hermetic pin; drop them and\ngit-core-doc.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rhdh-bot <rhdh-bot@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Frank Kong <50030060+Zaperex@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtDXsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABYMQAHTgTrfICHfGr3rrS56fGVoZ\nPYQ08PcSL/WnrszXqGS3qd4Ur+G6b0pd1yFoAd39FokFgMsbFs7xhIPZhRda0mAa\nPHkAcg4el5Su/J6VfIe5b6HeWs1Vv6IjKG2Ap7lIFemRCS2UcubC6KUL2n7PBle9\ncuX+7McyvRatKjHjtVoRe35nAgRDmKG1i++iyy5nP5XXWLtxMXqWhmAJrbRp4Bna\nryWVcPHtxqDNmhKZs4k+0zofn8k0jGbaugUE1uGwpbdc3EcGixcIMnAVJb60udZI\nrdXGIfMmuMvMaRcE/6SGXNtHI0N4LuoVpM8Ww3Bq3KbVUxS+uirkBXfzJPWPoghs\nhRlbpdfYe8xylv7raky7wr//s6flBZhglOollu446BNgE9jTKpo+h3DyEc3tM2af\nDzWRtmvzRPo0nuRhLUsyQ2jCFtsqmlmo6x2pAFxqPeGrQ1jIKEyR66/pOf2iJdqE\nixwsn7Ut17qlIi2O+QFKCOrLfhzJ+A+DWIK1YORbsH8ghTZVSoQLChPr3T+UAulM\nS8rM/lG/ABdnyJha1o1kJfMFHbdq2S6xgZoETRoLBXwrMBe6LlRPswjja58YFfWK\nR0IDBdvxvKAV/QvTlEAmoCUbRkZJyprKkNzuxRcmV2umJESUToDPngqYaTEgQLC/\nxVxFRAFNBaPx1WKzI8qK\n=yxd6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T20:26:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_even