/nickboldt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickboldt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/b8a7f5194c4b53dbde8514011e0329aa7143d540/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T21:07:23Z","email":"nboldt@redhat.com","name":"Nick Boldt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T21:07:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): prune and refresh TechDocs Python requirements (#5451)\n\n* chore(deps): prune and refresh TechDocs Python requirements\n\nSlim requirements.in to mkdocs-techdocs-core plus Hermeto-safe caps, and\nkeep requirements-build.in as real build-system deps only. Regenerated\nhashed lockfiles bump transitive packages (mkdocs, certifi, requests, etc.)\nwhile respecting techdocs-core pins and setuptools_scm<8 for sdist builds.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(deps): add poetry-core to hermetic pip build requirements\n\ntomlkit (pulled in by hatchling) builds with poetry-core; without it in\nrequirements-build.txt, offline sdist installs fail under Hermeto.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(deps): pin pluggy<1.6 and add calver for hermetic builds\n\npluggy 1.6+ requires setuptools-scm>=8 to build from sdist, which\nconflicts with our setuptools_scm<8 pin (python-dateutil / hatch-vcs).\nPin pluggy to 1.5.x and add calver for trove-classifiers sdists.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rhdh-bot <rhdh-bot@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d85a7a172f09de085e2108c58b200742a0d2774f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/d85a7a172f09de085e2108c58b200742a0d2774f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/b8a7f5194c4b53dbde8514011e0329aa7143d540","verification":{"payload":"tree d85a7a172f09de085e2108c58b200742a0d2774f\nparent b1e2f8a1bce196d38f1c9e87793af3304e6c88a0\nauthor Nick Boldt <nboldt@redhat.com> 1789765643 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789765643 -0300\n\nchore(deps): prune and refresh TechDocs Python requirements (#5451)\n\n* chore(deps): prune and refresh TechDocs Python requirements\n\nSlim requirements.in to mkdocs-techdocs-core plus Hermeto-safe caps, and\nkeep requirements-build.in as real build-system deps only. Regenerated\nhashed lockfiles bump transitive packages (mkdocs, certifi, requests, etc.)\nwhile respecting techdocs-core pins and setuptools_scm<8 for sdist builds.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(deps): add poetry-core to hermetic pip build requirements\n\ntomlkit (pulled in by hatchling) builds with poetry-core; without it in\nrequirements-build.txt, offline sdist installs fail under Hermeto.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(deps): pin pluggy<1.6 and add calver for hermetic builds\n\npluggy 1.6+ requires setuptools-scm>=8 to build from sdist, which\nconflicts with our setuptools_scm<8 pin (python-dateutil / hatch-vcs).\nPin pluggy to 1.5.x and add calver for trove-classifiers sdists.\n\nhttps://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHIDP-17016\n\nGenerated-by: cursor\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rh