t secret, so GitHub discovery and bulk-import fail with 401\nUnauthorized whenever the defaults kick in. GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_SECRET_RBAC\nwas also missing from the block.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17861e60b28757f2e1fa6cb9d4d63004e8c6de08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/17861e60b28757f2e1fa6cb9d4d63004e8c6de08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/b4eab2988824b146d8944e50e538856f2f6ffa6c","verification":{"payload":"tree 17861e60b28757f2e1fa6cb9d4d63004e8c6de08\nparent f47c6da327f4e59a60a76307cdceb9141ce698fa\nauthor Gustavo Lira e Silva <guga.java@gmail.com> 1789752291 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789752291 +0000\n\nfix(ci): correct default RBAC GitHub App env vars (#5442)\n\nThe default block (used whenever the per-run prefix rotation finds an\nincomplete _RBAC_<n> secret set) assigned the OPERATOR app''s CLIENT_SECRET\nto GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_RBAC — an app JWT can never be minted from a\nclient secret, so GitHub discovery and bulk-import fail with 401\nUnauthorized whenever the defaults kick in. GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_SECRET_RBAC\nwas also missing from the block.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrXPjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfQUQABi8099gysw8+7Ej7K361sWr\n3Mod8XC0skx9kvckW+bYyCHOxrU/NEHF/BW1RE7Hfl2lFJtaFqgNS98UBUDOYt1H\nsE/Yybu192ZJpE7pSjhJl7CdoBoRnzbgUBCnGEwL9KM8Liwd/TQhbLp/rDfGOGNM\nLfi8mm0xXOD/gyEvB6zCfni/5JbZ7zOMTDUrYoQjjuuJ3WXISNoZWxdO9aiHP4rE\nWu+IPA1HCae8QTn2BrDwCB2CMgmLo6MTiaocl9KrgggZMT0OIIBzoe7xv5eHGo5Z\nnCX/AyY9sTwaId37v8AsicbTFzRz+MB6E+RBtrpsz78db6thCLlF8JxNIgNcvZ+N\n75uLWPtZtKQiqHS8zSaoBtKHWZppqWxnPhN0T9k2FIyiJprNJ1kLMhlms32Ju7JX\nJiiSOVq/UT7uILTBXPdE8mB49DqbFECqSMSZJ2dsP2SSpIOMjaXi9sy1r9Y8MlWF\nTWIlB/+QLWe8jxsRTVOz3eypti9KTZ3r9cgoBC3VzynCU7nMSVJVSr+AJ9F0G70C\nZKd9QShnXajQN09ApLuiILCl8lI+Yi0i29ShrRQNM+wQcvJXiwbf7hvyoGJx644r\n6kge4G