ef: RHIDP-15873\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* fix(ci): install build tools for cluster-free harness\n\nbetter-sqlite3 13.x needs a native compile during yarn install. The\nPlaywright image only ships skopeo/jq today, so root install fails with\n\"not found: make\" after #5359.\n\nRef: RHIDP-15873\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* Revert \"fix(ci): install build tools for cluster-free harness\"\n\nThis reverts commit 111e151e1c8c181553483accd0baa7bea33c85fc.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"c433dd96d91986f28e1eb64ccb3e489240593fd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/c433dd96d91986f28e1eb64ccb3e489240593fd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/5fd3ececa7f462a2a77130328cad1664045a75a5","verification":{"payload":"tree c433dd96d91986f28e1eb64ccb3e489240593fd0\nparent da71952df81d1fc799c7710a257b441ab9704393\nauthor Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com> 1789491136 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789491136 +0200\n\nchore(deps): bump install-dynamic-plugins to 0.5.0 (#5402)\n\n* chore(deps): bump install-dynamic-plugins to 0.5.0\n\nRestrict ref:// resolution to OCI packages in include files, aligning\nthe init container with rhdh-operator#3473.\n\nRef: RHIDP-15873\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* fix(ci): install build tools for cluster-free harness\n\nbetter-sqlite3 13.x needs a native compile during yarn install. The\nPlaywright image only ships skopeo/jq today, so root install fails with\n\"not found: make\" after #5359.\n\nRef: RHIDP-15873\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>\n\n* Revert \"fix(ci): install build tools for cluster-free harness\"\n\nThis reverts commit 111e151e1c8c181553483accd0baa7bea33c85fc.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqXfACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFkIQAFKshB3HmdnY8