1d1fc799c7710a257b441ab9704393","sha":"da71952df81d1fc799c7710a257b441ab9704393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/da71952df81d1fc799c7710a257b441ab9704393"}],"sha":"5fd3ececa7f462a2a77130328cad1664045a75a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/5fd3ececa7f462a2a77130328cad1664045a75a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/695720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonkoops","id":695720,"login":"jonkoops","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonkoops","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/da71952df81d1fc799c7710a257b441ab9704393/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:15:02Z","email":"jonkoops@gmail.com","name":"Jon Koops"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:15:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: disable yarn install scripts now that better-sqlite3 uses prebuilds (#5405)\n\nbetter-sqlite3 was bumped to v13, which ships prebuilt binaries for common\nplatforms. We still had enableScripts: true from the Yarn 4.17 upgrade, when\nv12 needed a local compile. That made Yarn run node-gyp during install even\nwhen a prebuild was available, which broke cluster-free E2E on images without\na C++ toolchain.\n\nDrop enableScripts and the related root workarounds (dependenciesMeta,\nnode-gyp devDependency). Remove the e2e-tests postinstall Playwright hook\n(removing the need for --mode=skip-build on CI) in favor of documenting an\nexplicit playwright install step. Update stale comments and docs to match,\nincluding the e2e README prerequisites anchor after the postinstall heading\nwas removed.\n\nRef: RHDHBUGS-3725\n\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"02ac465998bfc43da058efbad06cc8f2427145a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/02ac465998bfc43da058efbad06cc8f2427145a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/da71952df81d1fc799c7710a257b441ab9704393","verification":{"payload":"tree 02ac465998bfc43da058efbad06cc8f2427145a2\nparent 93a56d326c2f378a6cd9ab7a296bc38997e53da6\nauthor Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com> 1789478102 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789478102 +0200\n\nfix: disable yarn install scripts now that better-sqlite3 uses prebuilds (#5405)\n\nbetter-sqlite3 was bumped to v13, which ships prebuilt binaries for common\nplatforms. We still had enableScripts: true from the Yarn 4.17 upgrade, when\nv12 needed a local compile. That made Yarn run node-gyp during install even\nwhen a prebuild was available, which broke cluster-free E2E on images without\na C++ toolchain.\n\nDrop enableScripts and the related root workarounds (dependenciesMeta,\nnode-gyp devDependency). Remove the e2e-tests postinstall Playwright hook\n(removing the need for --mode=skip-build on CI) in favor of documenting an\nexplicit playwright install step. Update stale comments and docs to match,\nincluding the e2e README prerequisites anchor after the postinstall heading\nwas removed.\n\nRef: RHDHBUGS-3725\n\nSigned-off-by: Jon Koops <jonkoops@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqUTWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAya