ithub.com/users/gustavolira/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavolira","id":1463004,"login":"gustavolira","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NjMwMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavolira/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavolira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavolira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavolira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavolira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavolira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/commits/e754f1de75bc60bb6ae03a68d5ce2f144bf03153/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:03:47Z","email":"guga.java@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Lira e Silva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:03:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: revert the nodejs-24-minimal bump that broke the hermetic build (#5390)\n\nmain has been red since fbd9a52b. The hermetic build fails on both arches at the\nskeleton stage:\n\n    Problem: conflicting requests\n     - nothing provides xz-libs(x86-64) = 1:5.6.2-4.el10_2.1\n       needed by xz-1:5.6.2-4.el10_2.1.x86_64\n\n#5384 bumped only the runner image, nodejs-24-minimal, from 10.2-1788245909 to\n10.2-1789045317. The skeleton stays on nodejs-24:10.2-1788939823, and that is\nnot an oversight: nodejs-24 has no newer tag, so the two images cannot be\naligned right now.\n\nrpm-lockfile-prototype resolves against the Containerfile and drops whatever the\nbase images already ship. Regenerated against the newer minimal image (#5389) it\ndropped xz-libs entirely — 4 occurrences before, 0 after — while keeping xz. The\nfailing dnf install runs in the skeleton stage, on the older image, where that\nxz-libs is not present.\n\nReverting both files together restores d1dbd50d''s combination, which built green\nat 17:55. Bumping the minimal image again should wait until nodejs-24 gets a\nmatching build, so the lockfile can be resolved against a consistent pair.\n\nNeither PR built this combination before it landed: #5384 carried [skip-build],\nand #5389''s own \"Build Image (Hermetic)\" step reports skipped, so its green\ncheck never compiled anything.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc8ada1dcf5b29864c53cebbdf6a654d9d5eea4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/trees/cc8ada1dcf5b29864c53cebbdf6a654d9d5eea4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh/git/commits/e754f1de75bc60bb6ae03a68d5ce2f144bf03153","verification":{"payload":"tree cc8ada1dcf5b29864c53cebbdf6a654d9d5eea4e\nparent 9d56afd833afda806da24e5d08ad967ce5696d78\nauthor Gustavo Lira e Silva <guga.java@gmail.com> 1789398227 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789398227 +0000\n\nfix: revert the nodejs-24-minimal bump that broke the hermetic build (#5390)\n\nmain has been red since fbd9a52b. The hermetic build fails on both arches at the\nskeleton stage:\n\n    Problem: conflicting requests\n     - nothing provides xz-libs(x86-64) = 1:5.6.2-4.el10_2.1\n       needed by xz-1:5.6.2-4.el10_2.1.x86_64\n\n#5384 bumped only the runner image, nodejs-24-minimal, from 10.2-1788245909 to\n10.2-1789045317. The skeleton stays on nodejs-24:10.2-1788939823, and that is\nnot an oversight: nodejs-24 has no newer tag, so the two images cannot be\naligned right now.\n\nrpm-lockfile-prototype resolves against the Containerfile and drops whatever the\nbase images already ship. Regenerated against the newer minimal image (#5389) it\ndropped xz-libs entirely — 4 occurrences before, 0 after — while keeping xz. The\nfailing dnf install runs in the skeleton stage, on the older image, where that\nxz-libs is not present.\n\nReverting both files together restores d1dbd50d''s combination, which built green\nat 17:55. Bumping the minimal image again should wait until nodejs-24 gets a\nmatching build, so the lockfile can be resolved against a consistent pair.\n\nNeither PR built this combination before it landed: #5384 carried [skip-build],\nand #5389''s own \"Build Image (Hermetic)\" step reports skipped, so its green\ncheck never compiled anything.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqAzTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjvgQAE3buR9FAlnJrsJx4YlqMl4y\nskgfhmKuB+4CK2nk1mp0SGFvCBP7XB4pOvPK6v66xpVHQF4zJXDV41uXtxmM5VZv\nVGDSU5p6GsIX0jH4fnmusiV6FyPg2n4Dj2vz7k137mLzqEX0SAnMvv/DL1g4upDE\nyrhhbI6Nsg1TMYIMg6TUM8HQKK+HIpOgGIjm9D7aDS13cSi3Xjz7WDRyYdgwACD1\niGkcpRKbgzo7/4yJjYTq1ZdVDa0JhwnPm0xkgETouBN9DRDN8t4ZRBY8r8NDrmjb\nIe9a9v7P+yKf8pfiJiceaRD3NWSZZrBxaPXcF+on7d7wgia/lwYRDzbxmk1L9tsE\n1cNYCTOAPZI5qaZ0BPcxab5ofOcUDBKKqBOkv8N8tT3cDK8iUKA3+7jVtoSuV5zC\nLPAefh/Z//kMs4EjkBA6YysCuDr27Wu5xL5SmXBI1feS7hPIeGi7HXv8l2DeK2Xg\nUDLNb8Mg5Enk+Lyy8gmSjGyxCO3Sqn6X1TW/fGxr56BKbRe/VkzyMLs5FOyFlon3\nHIEqwxphnI9Qbu8XtyverUx2IYIup5pXETx73tGvP8yS9k6jHmYKovYFrZM58G6v\n7SN0tPMnqpdIjFqhxjvJ+OmuEN9wNjWXRou/T4PWHVS/8U5gN1IosOODnTBbDKaO\nnloaEvFJzM/PlRw56c+J\n=rh8i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T15:03:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"sta