 consistent substrate\nbehind every section, not just the hero. Added a major/minor grid\nvariant (every 4th line stronger) and small corner crosshair marks\nas registration-mark-style details, reinforcing the technical-drawing\nidentity site-wide without adding motion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NxF5c9Swv9TgFt5gDt8xvJ","tree":{"sha":"429c7aac23bef2fe770636c203a72e20f78aa163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/git/trees/429c7aac23bef2fe770636c203a72e20f78aa163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/git/commits/3ecc3196dec3b7b3d3b032b42ea6aa1504dcbb7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37537011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy","id":37537011,"login":"AhmedTakeshy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTM3MDEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commit/3ecc3196dec3b7b3d3b032b42ea6aa1504dcbb7f","node_id":"C_kwDOI32GJNoAKDNlY2MzMTk2ZGVjM2I3YjNkM2IwMzJiNDJlYTZhYTE1MDRkY2JiN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commit/9c90c77645ea9a048ede140c1dc3e7cefedeeb96","sha":"9c90c77645ea9a048ede140c1dc3e7cefedeeb96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commits/9c90c77645ea9a048ede140c1dc3e7cefedeeb96"}],"sha":"3ecc3196dec3b7b3d3b032b42ea6aa1504dcbb7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commits/3ecc3196dec3b7b3d3b032b42ea6aa1504dcbb7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37537011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy","id":37537011,"login":"AhmedTakeshy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTM3MDEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commits/9c90c77645ea9a048ede140c1dc3e7cefedeeb96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:09:53Z","email":"Ahmedtakeshy7@gmail.com","name":"AhmedTakeshy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:09:53Z","email":"Ahmedtakeshy7@gmail.com","name":"AhmedTakeshy"},"message":"Redesign: systems & architecture identity\n\nFull visual redesign replacing the generic \"Framer Motion tutorial\nportfolio\" look (typing hero, autoplay skill carousel, animated\ncounters, magenta->cyan gradient, Orbitron font) with a distinctive\n\"systems architect\" identity aimed at the audience actually screening\nthis portfolio (dev-tools/AI companies like Deepgram, ElevenLabs).\n\n- New design tokens: dark graphite base, single schematic-redline\n  accent (#FF7A45), unified IBM Plex Sans/Mono type system\n- Signature element: an SVG architecture diagram in the hero, a real\n  simplified rendering of the Elonky migration (Monolith -> 6\n  modules), one orchestrated assemble animation on load, respects\n  prefers-reduced-motion\n- Capabilities: static spec-sheet grid replacing the autoplay\n  skill-meter carousel\n- Case studies: Elonky (flagship, real screenshots + live link,\n  honest \"led/architected within a team\" framing), Shifaref,\n  Doreyazilim -- each opens a modal (Radix Dialog) with a screenshot\n  carousel + problem/architecture/impact + tech tags\n- About: shortened narrative, dropped the animated counters\n- Nav: numbered mono index instead of icon pill\n- Fixed a real bug found during self-review: Contact relied on\n  Framer Motion''s whileInView to become visible at all, which can\n  fail to fire (reproduced via full-page screenshot capture) --\n  content should never depend on scroll-triggered opacity to exist\n- Metadata cleanup: dropped keyword-stuffed classification/category\n  fields, fixed hardcoded copyright years\n- Regenerated public/Ahmed.pdf from the corrected cv.md (old one was\n  missing the entire Kayra Export role and had wrong dates)\n- Removed now-unused deps (react-multi-carousel, react-type-animation,\n  react-countup, react-intersection-observer); added @radix-ui/react-dialog\n- Fixed a pre-existing ESLint flat-config gap (no .next/** ignore was\n  causing `npm run lint` to lint the compiled build output) and a\n  require()-in-TS lint error in tailwind.config.ts\n- Added package-lock.json (didn''t exist before -- likely the root\n  cause of an unrelated npm Arborist crash hit during this session)\n\nExplicitly NOT done: Next 16 / Tailwind v4 / dependency-version\nupgrades -- separate concern from a visual redesign, see spec''s\nrollout note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NxF5c9Swv9TgFt5gDt8xvJ","tree":{"sha":"98ef31ce3c0fd940db51d93d3cbd3d07c6123aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/git/trees/98ef31ce3c0fd940db51d93d3cbd3d07c6123aff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/git/commits/9c90c77645ea9a048ede140c1dc3e7cefedeeb96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37537011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy","id":37537011,"login":"AhmedTakeshy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTM3MDEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTakeshy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commit/9c90c77645ea9a048ede140c1dc3e7cefedeeb96","node_id":"C_kwDOI32GJNoAKDljOTBjNzc2NDVlYTlhMDQ4ZWRlMTQwYzFkYzNlN2NlZmVkZWViOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTakeshy/My-protfolio/commit/4fa7ba0611bf3e9645ac33308f4f16c32a2b122c","sha":"4fa7ba0611bf3e9645ac33308f4f16c32a2b122c","url":"https://ap